  "id": "pamelor",
  "term": "Pamelor",
  "definition": "Pamelor is nortriptyline hydrochloride, a tricyclic antidepressant used for brief treatment of several kinds of depression. It increases norepinephrine activity in the central nervous system by preventing its reuptake, and it also acts on alpha-adrenergic, histamine, and cholinergic receptors.",
